---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Base title="About" description="Ghulam Abbas: IT infrastructure and operations leader, CCIE Data Center, PMP, with 15+ years across government, industrial and multinational environments.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="narrow prose">
      <h1>About me</h1>
      <p>
        I'm {SITE.owner}, an IT infrastructure and operations leader based in {SITE.location}. For more than 15 years I
        have designed, secured and run the technology that organisations depend on: data centers, networks, ERP
        platforms, disaster recovery and cyber security programs.
      </p>
      <p>
        I started as a network engineer, building enterprise and carrier networks. I moved into designing a multi-agency
        government data center, consulting for Cisco clients across the region, and then leading IT for a large
        industrial company, where I answer for strategy, security and uptime at board level.
      </p>

      <h2>What I focus on</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Infrastructure and operations:</strong> data centers, high availability, disaster recovery and business continuity.</li>
        <li><strong>Cyber security and compliance:</strong> ISO 27001, Zero Trust thinking, firewalls, access control and security governance.</li>
        <li><strong>Digital transformation:</strong> ERP delivery, SD-WAN, cloud adoption and modernising legacy infrastructure.</li>
        <li><strong>Leading people and vendors:</strong> clear roadmaps, SLAs and teams that deliver.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Staying current</h2>
      <p>
        I attend the main industry events in person: Cisco Live in the USA (2024 and 2026) and Melbourne (2025), and
        SecTor in Toronto (2024 and 2026). In 2025 I also marked ten years as a CCIE.
        <a href="/work#conferences">See the photos and details</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Credentials</h2>
      <p>
        CCIE Data Center, PMP, CCNP Enterprise and Security, Juniper JNCIP-ENT, AWS Solutions Architect Associate,
        Microsoft Azure Administrator, and more. I hold a Master of Science in Telecommunication and an MBA.
        <a href="/work#certifications">See the full list</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Why this site</h2>
      <p>
        Good IT help is often hard to find, or buried in jargon. People lose time and money to problems that a clear
        explanation could have solved in ten minutes, and to security mistakes that are easy to avoid. This blog is my
        attempt to give back: practical fixes, plain-language security advice, and honest career guidance for people
        starting out or moving up in IT.
      </p>
      <p>
        I write in English. I'm Pakistani, based in Saudi Arabia, and I speak Urdu and Punjabi as well.
      </p>

      <div class="note">
        <p><strong>Want to connect?</strong> Find me on <a href={SITE.linkedin} rel="me noopener" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a> or
        <a href="/contact">send a message</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
